---
import titleLogo from '../assets/title.png'
import profileImg from '../assets/profile-img.jpg'
import RootLayout from '../layouts/RootLayout.astro'
import CommonCopyRights from '../components/CommonCopyRights.astro'

// Welcome to Astro! Wondering what to do next? Check out the Astro documentation at https://docs.astro.build
// Don't want to use any of this? Delete everything in this file, the `assets`, `components`, and `layouts` directories, and start fresh.
---

<RootLayout>
  <!-- Navigator -->
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-20 border-b border-stone-200 bg-white/9 backdrop-blur">
    <nav class="mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-3xl items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4">
      <img src={titleLogo.src} alt="Aksiomo" class="h-11 w-auto" />
      <div class="h-full py-2 gap-2 select-none hidden sm:flex">
        <div class="h-full flex items-center justify-center px-2 py-4 hover:bg-stone-200 cursor-pointer">
          <a>Developer</a>
        </div>
        <div class="h-full flex items-center justify-center px-2 py-4 hover:bg-stone-200 cursor-pointer">
          <a href="/zh-cn/personal">Personal</a>
        </div>
        <div class="h-full flex items-center justify-center px-2 py-4 hover:bg-stone-200 cursor-not-allowed">
          <a class="cursor-not-allowed">ACGN</a>
        </div>
        <div class="h-full flex items-center justify-center px-2 py-4 hover:bg-stone-200 cursor-not-allowed">
          <a class="cursor-not-allowed">Emotional-Trash</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <div class="flex flex-col bg-stone-50">
    <div class="bg-[#5A5A6E] text-[#F1F1F1] border-b border-stone-200 h-[280px] flex flex-col justify-end">
      <div class="flex flex-col mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-[36px] font-bold">Welcome to Aksiomo's Blog</h1>
        <h1 class="text-[24px] hidden sm:block ml-[30%] leading-5">
          Saluton al Blogo de Aksiomo
        </h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Content flow: 窄屏单列 / 宽屏双列瀑布 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2 max-w-max my-6 mx-4 sm:mx-auto">
      <!-- 左列：卡 1, 3, 5... -->
      <div class="flex flex-1 max-w-sm flex-col gap-2 items-center sm:items-end">
        <div class="w-full rounded overflow-hidden shadow-lg bg-white">
          <img src={profileImg.src} class="w-full" />
          <div class="px-6 py-4">
            <div class="font-bold text-xl">About Aksiomo</div>
            <div class="text-md text-stone-500 mb-2">关于我</div>
            <!-- English part -->
            <section class="text-gray-700 text-base">
              <p class="indent-4">
                A full-stack-oriented programmer and open-source developer who
                also enjoys writing essays and prose. Bird enthusiast.
              </p>
              <p class="indent-4">
                Loves learning languages—both natural and computer languages
                (high-level programming languages)—and has an interest in
                linguistics. Currently studying English and Esperanto on the
                natural-language side, while focusing on Rust and Node for
                programming (though not limited to those; see my developer
                résumé for details).
              </p>
              <p class="indent-4">
                I've had many aliases in the past (especially on GitHub), but
                they were all me.
              </p>
              <p class="indent-4">
                I'm an altruist with a touch of histrionic personality, and an
                idealist who believes in pacifism—hoping to be seen, valued, and
                needed.
              </p>
            </section>
            <hr class="my-1" />
            <!-- Chinese part -->
            <section class="text-gray-500 text-base">
              <p class="indent-4">
                面向全栈的程序员兼开源开发者，也喜欢写杂文和散文。鸟类爱好者。
              </p>
              <p class="indent-4">
                喜欢学习语言，涵盖自然语言和计算机语言（高级程序设计语言），对语言学有兴趣。自然语言方面目前在学习英语和世界语，而程序设计语言则是聚焦于Rust和Node（但不止于此，这部分详情可以看我的开发者简历）。
              </p>
              <p class="indent-4">
                我的过去有很多马甲（尤其在Github上），但都是我本人。
              </p>
              <p class="indent-4">
                我是一个带一点表演型人格的利他主义者，也是一个信奉和平主义的理想主义者，希望被看到，被重视，被需要。
              </p>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 右列：卡 2, 4, 6... -->
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col max-w-sm gap-2 items-center sm:items-start">
        <div class="w-full rounded overflow-hidden shadow-lg bg-white">
          <div class="px-6 py-4">
            <div class="font-bold text-xl">On Planning</div>
            <div class="text-md text-stone-500 mb-2">计划中的项目</div>
            <!-- English part -->
            <section class="text-gray-700 text-base">
              <ol class="list-disc">
                <li>aksiomo-blog - This blog, based on Astro</li>
                <li>
                  oasis — Open-source OA project in collaboration with a former
                  colleague, based on Gin and TanStack
                </li>
                <li>
                  ao-finance — AI-led personal bookkeeping app, based on Next
                </li>
                <li>
                  ao-resume-genor — Personally led generator that builds full
                  résumés from fragmented skills, based on Next
                </li>
                <li>
                  ao-slave-battlefield — Personally led adult game inspired by
                  ERAKanon, based on React; currently in preparation
                </li>
              </ol>
            </section>
            <hr class="my-1" />
            <!-- Chinese part -->
            <section class="text-gray-500 text-base">
              <ol class="list-disc">
                <li>aksiomo-blog - 当前这个博客，基于Astro</li>
                <li>oasis - 和前同事合作的开源OA项目，基于Gin和Tanstack</li>
                <li>ao-finance - AI主导开发的个人记账软件，基于Next</li>
                <li>
                  ao-resume-genor -
                  个人主导开发的基于碎片技能生成完整简历的生成器，基于Next
                </li>
                <li>
                  ao-slave-battlefield -
                  个人主导开发的仿ERAKanon成人游戏，基于React，目前在筹备阶段
                </li>
              </ol>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full rounded overflow-hidden shadow-lg bg-white">
          <div class="px-6 py-4">
            <div class="font-bold text-xl">Recent Articles</div>
            <div class="text-md text-stone-500 mb-2">最近的一些文章</div>
            <!-- English part -->
            <section class="text-gray-700 text-base"></section>
            <hr class="my-1" />
            <!-- Chinese part -->
            <section class="text-gray-500 text-base"></section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <footer>
    <div class="mx-4 sm:mx-auto max-w-3xl py-6 text-stone-900">
      <p>
        This page is made by human basely. Grok supports English translating.
      </p>
      <CommonCopyRights />
    </div>
  </footer>
</RootLayout>
